A friend of mine had a similar experience.  He was fighting an
invisible vampire at the Mine's End and things were going poorly for
him, so he zapped it with an unidentified wand.  It just happened to
turn into a giant flea, which remained invisible and proceeded to
breed explosively (as happens at times even though it's apparently not
supposed to) until he had been killed.  Of course, this left a bones
level.  The next time he reached the mine's end, it was via a trap
door.  He waded through the infinitely multiplying horde with the help
of Elbereth and actually managed to make it up the stairs. 
Unfortunately, since the flea had originally been a vampire, several
followed him up the stairs and proceeded to explosively breed
throughout the next level, cutting him down and leaving another bones
level.  Should be fun for whatever Hearse users end up with those
accursed bones.

